---
const target = "/kurse/#style-poster-gallery";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content={`0; url=${target}`} />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://elitedancestudio.de/kurse/" />
    <title>Kurse & Styles | Elite Dance Studio</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Die Tanzstyles findest du jetzt gemeinsam mit allen Kursen. <a href={target}>Kurse & Styles öffnen</a>.</p>
    <script is:inline define:vars={{ target }}>window.location.replace(target);</script>
  </body>
</html>
